---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="找不到頁面｜雲橙工作室" noindex={true}><section class="not-found"><strong>404</strong><h1>這個頁面暫時找不到</h1><p>網址可能已經變更，或頁面不存在。</p><a class="button" href="/">回到首頁　↗</a></section></Base>
<style>.not-found{min-height:80vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:100px 24px}.not-found strong{font-size:clamp(100px,20vw,220px);line-height:1;color:#f5a62315}.not-found h1{font-size:34px;margin:-30px 0 5px}.not-found p{color:#777;margin-bottom:24px}</style>
